# Admin SQL — schema and migrations ARE tracked (the folder-wide ignore was
# lifted deliberately so migrations are reviewable and rebuildable from source).
# supabase/admin/
#
# Exception: ad-hoc diagnostic queries that hardcode a real user's email or id.
# This repo is public — anything under supabase/admin/ now ships to the world by
# default, so one-off queries against production data must stay local. Add new
# ones here, or parameterise the identifier before committing.
supabase/admin/diagnose_recurring_duplicates.sql

# Supabase CLI version-check cache — rewritten on every CLI invocation.
# project-ref stays tracked so a clone knows which project this is.
supabase/.temp/cli-latest
